### ======================================================
### HOW TO TEST PROTECTED ROUTES IN REST CLIENT
### ======================================================
###
### STEP 1: Log in through the browser
###         → http://localhost:5500/index.html
###
### STEP 2: Open Chrome DevTools
###         → F12 → Application → Cookies → http://localhost:8000
###         → Find "access_token" and copy its value
###
### STEP 3: Paste the token in the Cookie header below
###         → Cookie: access_token=<paste_here>
###
### STEP 4: Token expires in 15 minutes
###         → If you get 401, repeat steps 1-3
###
### STEP 5: DO NOT use the Google id_token
###         → Only the access_token issued by this server works
###
### ======================================================

POST http://localhost:8000/task/add
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token=<paste_access_token_here>

{
    "title": "Task 1",
    "details": "This is the description",
    "current_status": "doing"
}